  "mechanicalClosure": [
    "Complete parent journal and null header anchor required; exact current expected tail/lock/CAS remain mandatory.",
    "PROFILE commits complete normalized existing-alt initializer with only anchor=null and retains parent tail/fee ledger before Clock; ordinary mutation is blocked.",
    "Raw40-byte exact Clock address/owner/nonexec/base64 and u64 slot/context/i64 decode; rawslot and context must dominate parent inclusion/poststate and planner/ALT contexts.",
    "Only the anchor field changes in postManifest. Actual pinned planner derives native315-byte PIV1IN01 offset299, compact bytes, ordered native roles and nine unsigned packets.",
    "Independent byte/header/index/address/privilege/hash checks bind native/compact/roles; same stable lock/CAS/fsync writes one terminal SEAL. Reopen rederives stored profile/seal.",
    "Old APPEND/START, reprofile and recapture are blocked; no child journal or budget reset API. PROFILE reserves one later SEAL record slot."
  ],
